I tap the 'Submit' button on the screen.
A new message appears on the screen.
It says, "An OTP is sent to your registered mobile number."
I take my phone in my hand and wait.
A timer starts on the screen.
Sixty seconds, fifty seconds, forty seconds...
A full minute runs out.
But I do not get any message.
I click on the 'Send new code' button.
I look out the window while waiting again.
It is raining heavily outside.
Rainwater is sliding down the glass.
At night, these government servers usually run very slow.
Technical issues often arise on such websites.
I look at my phone again.
The second timer also runs out.
And the second code never comes either.
I let out a sigh of frustration.
